data: {"id": "d78aa47db8864ec1-thinking-layer-243", "run_id": "d78aa47db8864ec1", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "该 Pod 的状态确认为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。由于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 可能由多种原因引起（如 OOMKilled、应用崩溃、配置错误、探针失败等），我需要获取相关的诊断手册来辅助判断和收集证据。根据可能的异常类型，我将获取以下 Runbook：\n1. `pod-oomkilled.md`：排查是否因内存超限被杀。\n2. `pod-crashloop-runtime.md`：排查进程退出、配置错误或探针问题。\n3. `pod-config-error.md`：排查配置缺失导致的崩溃。\n\n我将首先获取 `pod-oomkilled.md` 和 `pod-crashloop-runtime.md`。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789391892558}

