data: {"id": "d78aa47db8864ec1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1691", "run_id": "d78aa47db8864ec1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已采集的事实，对 `aiops-case-v17/workload` 的诊断分析如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n*   **Pod:** `workload`\n*   **Namespace:** `aiops-case-v17`\n*   **UID:** `85aece07-6ffa-41db-9e5a-f351771a8864`\n*   **当前状态:** `Running` (Phase), Reason: `CrashLoopBackOff`\n*   **重启次数:** 7次\n*   **节点:** `node2`\n\n### 2. 证据汇总与因果分析\n\n**支持 \"CrashLoopBackOffRuntime\" 的证据：**\n1.  **退出码 137 (OOMKilled):** `kubectl_describe` 和 `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示 Container `app` 的最后退出码为 137，且状态信息明确提及 `OOMKilled`。这通常意味着进程被 Linux OOM Killer 终止，原因是内存使用超过了限制。\n2.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789391973466, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

